2026-08-16T14:34:39Z    [ADI:Adjusted diluted EPS] GATE critic: The proposed FY2026Q3 adjusted diluted EPS of $3.72265 is outside Analog Devices’ own guidance range of $3.30 ± $0.15 (i.e., $3.15–$3.45) for that same period, exceeding the top end by $0.27265 (~7.9%).
2026-08-16T14:34:43Z    [DE:Production & Precision Ag operating profit] GATE critic: The FY2025 Q3 anchor you used ($580m) is from the wrong segment. The $580 → $1,162 (−50%) line you cite corresponds to Small Ag & Turf in Deere’s segment table, not Production & Precision Ag. Using a Small Ag & Turf figure as the base makes the FY2026 Q3 PPA operating‑profit estimate invalid. This can be checked directly against Deere’s FY2025 Q3 segment operating‑profit table.
